# Conditional Multiple Parent Values Example
# Multiple parent values each mapping to different child concept value sets.
# From Story121/Story122: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer — Conditional

concepts
	Country=[Values[USA, Canada, Mexico]]
	# US regions
	Country[USA] => Region=[Values[North, South, East, West]]
	# Canadian provinces
	Country[Canada] => Province=[Values[Ontario, Quebec, BC]]
	# Mexican states
	Country[Mexico] => State=[Values[Jalisco, Oaxaca, Yucatan]]
